   "body": "In UP4 plugin, we currently use a simple list for `tunnelPeerIDsPool` and `applicationIDsPool`. This may not be reliable as they might be duplicates in the pool due to a bug, leading to a conflicting IDs. The Set guarantees the uniqueness of IDs in the pool. \r\n\r\nThe Set is already used for Meter IDs in PR #439. ",
